<hr data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1015">
<h2 data-start=3D"1017" data-end=3D"1053">=F0=9F=94=80 2. M=C3=A9thodes HTT=
P : GET vs POST</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1055" data-end=3D"1171">Les m=C3=A9thodes <code data-start=
=3D"1068" data-end=3D"1073">GET</code> et <code data-start=3D"1077" data-en=
d=3D"1083">POST</code> sont deux fa=C3=A7ons diff=C3=A9rentes d'envoyer des=
 donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 un serveur via un formulaire HTML.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1173" data-end=3D"1183">A. GET</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1185" data-end=3D"1411">
<li data-start=3D"1185" data-end=3D"1236">
<p data-start=3D"1187" data-end=3D"1236"><strong data-start=3D"1187" data-e=
nd=3D"1209">Visible dans l=E2=80=99URL</strong> (ex : <code data-start=3D"1=
216" data-end=3D"1235">page.php?nom=3DJean</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1237" data-end=3D"1300">
<p data-start=3D"1239" data-end=3D"1300"><strong data-start=3D"1239" data-e=
nd=3D"1259">Limit=C3=A9 en taille</strong> (~2048 caract=C3=A8res selon les=
 navigateurs)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1344">
<p data-start=3D"1303" data-end=3D"1344"><strong data-start=3D"1303" data-e=
nd=3D"1329">Peut =C3=AAtre mis en cache</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"1=
333" data-end=3D"1344">partag=C3=A9</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1345" data-end=3D"1411">
<p data-start=3D"1347" data-end=3D"1411"><strong data-start=3D"1347" data-e=
nd=3D"1388">Utilis=C3=A9 pour des actions idempotentes</strong> (recherches=
, filtres=E2=80=A6)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1424">B. POST</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1426" data-end=3D"1669">
<li data-start=3D"1426" data-end=3D"1498">
<p data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1498"><strong data-start=3D"1428" data-e=
nd=3D"1452">Invisible dans l=E2=80=99URL</strong>, donn=C3=A9es envoy=C3=A9=
es dans le corps de la requ=C3=AAte</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1499" data-end=3D"1537">
<p data-start=3D"1501" data-end=3D"1537"><strong data-start=3D"1501" data-e=
nd=3D"1537">Pas de limite pratique de taille</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1538" data-end=3D"1596">
<p data-start=3D"1540" data-end=3D"1596"><strong data-start=3D"1540" data-e=
nd=3D"1596">Plus s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9 pour transmettre des donn=C3=A9es sensi=
bles</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1597" data-end=3D"1669">
<p data-start=3D"1599" data-end=3D"1669"><strong data-start=3D"1599" data-e=
nd=3D"1669">Utilis=C3=A9 pour des actions ayant des effets (ajout, modifica=
tion...)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
