<h2 data-start=3D"5007" data-end=3D"5036">=F0=9F=93=A6 10. Exercices pratiq=
ues</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"5038" data-end=3D"5424">
<li data-start=3D"5038" data-end=3D"5147">
