<hr data-start=3D"6660" data-end=3D"6663">
<h2 data-start=3D"6665" data-end=3D"6694">=F0=9F=A7=AA 12. Exercices pratiq=
ues</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"6696" data-end=3D"7007">
<li data-start=3D"6696" data-end=3D"6775">
<p data-start=3D"6699" data-end=3D"6775">Cr=C3=A9ez un formulaire de login =
