<h2 data-start=3D"4981" data-end=3D"5013">=F0=9F=9B=91 11. =C3=80 ne surtou=
t pas faire</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5015" data-end=3D"5281">
<li data-start=3D"5015" data-end=3D"5082">
<p data-start=3D"5017" data-end=3D"5082">=E2=9D=8C Ne jamais faire confianc=
e =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"5047" data-end=3D"5054">$_GET</code>, <code da=
ta-start=3D"5056" data-end=3D"5064">$_POST</code>, <code data-start=3D"5066=
" data-end=3D"5076">$_COOKIE</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5083" data-end=3D"5148">
<p data-start=3D"5085" data-end=3D"5148">=E2=9D=8C Ne jamais afficher une v=
aleur utilisateur sans <strong data-start=3D"5134" data-end=3D"5148">l=E2=
=80=99=C3=A9chapper</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5149" data-end=3D"5215">
<p data-start=3D"5151" data-end=3D"5215">=E2=9D=8C Ne pas =C3=A9chapper une=
 valeur dans des attributs ou du JavaScript</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5216" data-end=3D"5281">
<p data-start=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5281">=E2=9D=8C Croire que les validateu=
rs c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client (JavaScript) suffisent</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5283" data-end=3D"5286">
<h2 data-start=3D"5288" data-end=3D"5323">=E2=9C=85 12. Bonnes pratiques g=
=C3=A9n=C3=A9rales</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"5325" data-end=3D"5741">
<li data-start=3D"5325" data-end=3D"5395">
<p data-start=3D"5328" data-end=3D"5395"><strong data-start=3D"5328" data-e=
nd=3D"5345">=C3=89chappez tout</strong> ce qui vient de l=E2=80=99utilisate=
ur avant de l=E2=80=99afficher</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5396" data-end=3D"5457">
<p data-start=3D"5399" data-end=3D"5457">Utilisez toujours <code data-start=
=3D"5417" data-end=3D"5437">htmlspecialchars()</code> (avec <code data-star=
t=3D"5444" data-end=3D"5456">ENT_QUOTES</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5458" data-end=3D"5484">
<p data-start=3D"5461" data-end=3D"5484">Travaillez en <strong data-start=
=3D"5475" data-end=3D"5484">UTF-8</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5485" data-end=3D"5546">
<p data-start=3D"5488" data-end=3D"5546">=C3=89vitez les insertions de donn=
=C3=A9es dans le JavaScript inline</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5547" data-end=3D"5655">
<p data-start=3D"5550" data-end=3D"5655">Ajoutez des <strong data-start=3D"=
5562" data-end=3D"5595">Content Security Policy (CSP)</strong> c=C3=B4t=C3=
=A9 serveur pour interdire le JavaScript externe ou inline</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5656" data-end=3D"5741">
<p data-start=3D"5659" data-end=3D"5741">Nettoyez les donn=C3=A9es avec <co=
de data-start=3D"5685" data-end=3D"5701">filter_input()</code> ou <code dat=
a-start=3D"5705" data-end=3D"5719">filter_var()</code> avant de les affiche=
r</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"5743" data-end=3D"5746">
<h2 data-start=3D"5748" data-end=3D"5777">=F0=9F=A7=AA 13. Exercices pratiq=
ues</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"5779" data-end=3D"6107">
<li data-start=3D"5779" data-end=3D"5885">
<p data-start=3D"5782" data-end=3D"5885">Cr=C3=A9ez un formulaire de commen=
taire. Affichez les commentaires soumis en utilisant <code data-start=3D"58=
