<h2 data-start=3D"6090" data-end=3D"6110">=F0=9F=93=8C 15. Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6112" data-end=3D"6497">
<li data-start=3D"6112" data-end=3D"6236">
<p data-start=3D"6114" data-end=3D"6236">PHP permet une manipulation <stron=
g data-start=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6183">tr=C3=A8s fine et performante des f=
ichiers</strong> via <code data-start=3D"6188" data-end=3D"6197">fopen()</c=
ode>, <code data-start=3D"6199" data-end=3D"6208">fread()</code>, <code dat=
a-start=3D"6210" data-end=3D"6220">fwrite()</code>, et <code data-start=3D"=
6225" data-end=3D"6235">fclose()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6237" data-end=3D"6357">
<p data-start=3D"6239" data-end=3D"6357">Il est crucial de g=C3=A9rer corre=
ctement <strong data-start=3D"6276" data-end=3D"6291">les erreurs</strong> =
et <strong data-start=3D"6295" data-end=3D"6310">les verrous</strong> pour =
=C3=A9viter des conflits ou pertes de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6358" data-end=3D"6497">
<p data-start=3D"6360" data-end=3D"6497">Pour des usages simples, pr=C3=A9f=
=C3=A9rez les fonctions comme <code data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6435">f=
ile_get_contents()</code> ou <code data-start=3D"6439" data-end=3D"6460">fi=
le_put_contents()</code> qui simplifient la lecture/=C3=A9criture.</p>
</li>
</ul>
