<hr data-start=3D"6845" data-end=3D"6848">
<h2 data-start=3D"6850" data-end=3D"6908">10. Optimisations et conseils pou=
r d=C3=A9veloppeurs experts</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6910" data-end=3D"7407">
<li data-start=3D"6910" data-end=3D"6997">
<p data-start=3D"6912" data-end=3D"6997">Utiliser <code data-start=3D"6921"=
 data-end=3D"6944">session_write_close()</code> pour lib=C3=A9rer le verrou=
 de session d=C3=A8s que possible</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6998" data-end=3D"7063">
<p data-start=3D"7000" data-end=3D"7063">Limiter la dur=C3=A9e de vie des s=
essions pour r=C3=A9duire les risques</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7064" data-end=3D"7141">
<p data-start=3D"7066" data-end=3D"7141">Surveillez la taille des donn=C3=
=A9es stock=C3=A9es en session (=C3=A9vitez gros objets)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7142" data-end=3D"7261">
<p data-start=3D"7144" data-end=3D"7261">Pour des applications hautement sc=
alables, externalisez la gestion des sessions (Redis, Memcached, base de do=
nn=C3=A9es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7262" data-end=3D"7407">
<p data-start=3D"7264" data-end=3D"7407">Prot=C3=A9gez vos sessions contre =
le d=C3=A9tournement (fixation de session, fixation d=E2=80=99IP, renouvell=
ement p=C3=A9riodique d=E2=80=99ID via <code data-start=3D"7381" data-end=
=3D"7406">session_regenerate_id()</code>)</p>
</li>
