<hr data-start=3D"4338" data-end=3D"4341">
<h2 data-start=3D"4343" data-end=3D"4392">6. Types de donn=C3=A9es autoris=
=C3=A9s dans <code data-start=3D"4381" data-end=3D"4392">$_SESSION</code></=
h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4412">6.1. Support=C3=A9s</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4414" data-end=3D"4523">
<li data-start=3D"4414" data-end=3D"4468">
<p data-start=3D"4416" data-end=3D"4468">Types scalaires : <code data-start=
=3D"4434" data-end=3D"4442">string</code>, <code data-start=3D"4444" data-e=
nd=3D"4449">int</code>, <code data-start=3D"4451" data-end=3D"4458">float</=
code>, <code data-start=3D"4460" data-end=3D"4466">bool</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4469" data-end=3D"4500">
<p data-start=3D"4471" data-end=3D"4500">Tableaux multidimensionnels</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4501" data-end=3D"4523">
<p data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4523">Objets s=C3=A9rialisables</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4525" data-end=3D"4545">6.2. Limitations</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4826">
<li data-start=3D"4547" data-end=3D"4654">
<p data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4654">Les ressources (ex : connexions ba=
se de donn=C3=A9es, ressources fichiers) <strong data-start=3D"4619" data-e=
nd=3D"4637">ne peuvent pas</strong> =C3=AAtre stock=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4655" data-end=3D"4743">
<p data-start=3D"4657" data-end=3D"4743">Les objets doivent =C3=AAtre <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4681" data-end=3D"4698">s=C3=A9rialisables</strong> (la pl=
upart des objets standards le sont).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4744" data-end=3D"4826">
<p data-start=3D"4746" data-end=3D"4826">=C3=89vitez de stocker des donn=C3=
=A9es trop volumineuses pour ne pas alourdir la session.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4828" data-end=3D"4831">
<h2 data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4894">7. Bonnes pratiques pour la gesti=
on des donn=C3=A9es en session</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4896" data-end=3D"4929">7.1. Garder la session l=C3=A9g=
=C3=A8re</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5143">
<li data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5036">
<p data-start=3D"4933" data-end=3D"5036">Stockez uniquement les donn=C3=A9e=
s n=C3=A9cessaires (ex : identifiant utilisateur, r=C3=B4le, pr=C3=A9f=C3=
=A9rences l=C3=A9g=C3=A8res).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5037" data-end=3D"5143">
<p data-start=3D"5039" data-end=3D"5143">Pour de grandes donn=C3=A9es, util=
isez une base ou un cache externe et stockez l=E2=80=99identifiant dans la =
session.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5145" data-end=3D"5223">7.2. Ne jamais stocker de donn=C3=
=A9es sensibles non chiffr=C3=A9es sans pr=C3=A9cautions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5405">
<li data-start=3D"5225" data-end=3D"5352">
<p data-start=3D"5227" data-end=3D"5352">Bien que les donn=C3=A9es soient s=
tock=C3=A9es c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 serveur, si un attaquant acc=C3=A8de au serveur=
, il peut lire les fichiers de session.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5353" data-end=3D"5405">
<p data-start=3D"5355" data-end=3D"5405">Pensez =C3=A0 chiffrer des donn=C3=
=A9es sensibles si besoin.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5407" data-end=3D"5466">7.3. Renouveler l=E2=80=99ID de s=
ession apr=C3=A8s actions sensibles</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5468" data-end=3D"5616">
<li data-start=3D"5468" data-end=3D"5616">
<p data-start=3D"5470" data-end=3D"5616">Pour limiter les risques de fixati=
on de session, utilisez <code data-start=3D"5528" data-end=3D"5557">session=
_regenerate_id(true)</code> apr=C3=A8s une authentification ou un changemen=
t de privil=C3=A8ges.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5618" data-end=3D"5621">
<h2 data-start=3D"5623" data-end=3D"5674">8. Gestion avanc=C3=A9e : S=C3=A9=
rialisation personnalis=C3=A9e</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5676" data-end=3D"5848">Si vous stockez des objets complex=
es, vous pouvez d=C3=A9finir dans vos classes les m=C3=A9thodes <code data-=
start=3D"5764" data-end=3D"5775">__sleep()</code> et <code data-start=3D"57=
79" data-end=3D"5791">__wakeup()</code> pour personnaliser la s=C3=A9rialis=
ation et la restauration :</p>
