<hr data-start=3D"283" data-end=3D"286">
<h1 data-start=3D"288" data-end=3D"350">Programmation interm=C3=A9diaire av=
ec PHP =E2=86=92 Sessions et Cookies</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"351" data-end=3D"405">Utilisation des cookies (<code data=
-start=3D"379" data-end=3D"390">setcookie</code>, <code data-start=3D"392" =
