<li data-start=3D"4048" data-end=3D"4102">
<p data-start=3D"4050" data-end=3D"4102">Cela indique au navigateur de supp=
rimer le cookie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4103" data-end=3D"4214">
<p data-start=3D"4105" data-end=3D"4214">Il faut que le nom, le chemin et l=
e domaine soient les m=C3=AAmes que ceux utilis=C3=A9s lors de la cr=C3=A9a=
tion du cookie.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4216" data-end=3D"4219">
<h2 data-start=3D"4221" data-end=3D"4262">7. Param=C3=A8tres avanc=C3=A9s d=
e <code data-start=3D"4249" data-end=3D"4262">setcookie()</code></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4290">7.1. Domaine et chemin</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4292" data-end=3D"4702">
<li data-start=3D"4292" data-end=3D"4505">
<p data-start=3D"4294" data-end=3D"4371"><code data-start=3D"4294" data-end=
=3D"4301">$path</code> (par d=C3=A9faut <code data-start=3D"4314" data-end=
=3D"4319">" "</code> vide) d=C3=A9finit l=E2=80=99URL o=C3=B9 le cookie ser=
a accessible.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4374" data-end=3D"4505">
<li data-start=3D"4374" data-end=3D"4434">
<p data-start=3D"4376" data-end=3D"4434">Exemple: <code data-start=3D"4385"=
 data-end=3D"4388">/</code> rend le cookie accessible sur tout le site.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4437" data-end=3D"4505">
<p data-start=3D"4439" data-end=3D"4505">Exemple: <code data-start=3D"4448"=
 data-end=3D"4457">/admin/</code> restreint le cookie aux pages sous <code =
data-start=3D"4493" data-end=3D"4502">/admin/</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4507" data-end=3D"4702">
<p data-start=3D"4509" data-end=3D"4619"><code data-start=3D"4509" data-end=
=3D"4518">$domain</code> permet de d=C3=A9finir le domaine. Par d=C3=A9faut=
, le cookie est valable uniquement pour le domaine actuel.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4622" data-end=3D"4702">
<li data-start=3D"4622" data-end=3D"4702">
<p data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4702">Exemple : <code data-start=3D"4634=
" data-end=3D"4648">.example.com</code> rend le cookie accessible sur tous =
les sous-domaines.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4704" data-end=3D"4734">7.2. S=C3=A9curiser les cookies</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4736" data-end=3D"5084">
<li data-start=3D"4736" data-end=3D"4818">
<p data-start=3D"4738" data-end=3D"4818"><code data-start=3D"4738" data-end=
=3D"4754">$secure =3D true</code> garantit que le cookie est transmis <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4791" data-end=3D"4815">uniquement via HTTPS</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4819" data-end=3D"4926">
<p data-start=3D"4821" data-end=3D"4926"><code data-start=3D"4821" data-end=
=3D"4839">$httponly =3D true</code> emp=C3=AAche l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s au co=
okie via JavaScript (protection contre certaines attaques XSS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4927" data-end=3D"5084">
<p data-start=3D"4929" data-end=3D"5084">Depuis PHP 7.3, on peut aussi util=
iser l=E2=80=99option <code data-start=3D"4977" data-end=3D"4987">samesite<=
/code> pour limiter les envois de cookies aux requ=C3=AAtes provenant du m=
=C3=AAme site (protection contre CSRF).</p>
</li>
</ul>
