<hr data-start=3D"5348" data-end=3D"5351">
<h2 data-start=3D"5353" data-end=3D"5422">8. Gestion des cookies complexes =
: stocker des donn=C3=A9es structur=C3=A9es</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5424" data-end=3D"5478">8.1. Stocker des tableaux ou obje=
ts dans un cookie</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5480" data-end=3D"5627">
<li data-start=3D"5480" data-end=3D"5545">
<p data-start=3D"5482" data-end=3D"5545">Les cookies ne peuvent stocker que=
 des cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5546" data-end=3D"5627">
<p data-start=3D"5548" data-end=3D"5627">Pour stocker un tableau, il faut l=
e convertir en string, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement via JSON.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class=3D"overflow-visible!" data-start=3D"5629" data-end=3D"5891"><div=
 class=3D"contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border=
