<h3 data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5909">8.2. Limites</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5911" data-end=3D"6023">
<li data-start=3D"5911" data-end=3D"5954">
<p data-start=3D"5913" data-end=3D"5954">La taille maximale est limit=C3=A9=
e (~4 Ko).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5955" data-end=3D"6023">
<p data-start=3D"5957" data-end=3D"6023">Ne stockez pas d=E2=80=99informati=
ons sensibles en clair dans les cookies.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6025" data-end=3D"6028">
<h2 data-start=3D"6030" data-end=3D"6056">9. S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des cookies=
</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6058" data-end=3D"6102">9.1. Protection contre le vol de =
cookies</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6104" data-end=3D"6279">
<li data-start=3D"6104" data-end=3D"6144">
<p data-start=3D"6106" data-end=3D"6144">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6115"=
 data-end=3D"6123">secure</code> pour forcer HTTPS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6145" data-end=3D"6201">
<p data-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6201">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6156"=
 data-end=3D"6166">httponly</code> pour emp=C3=AAcher le JS d=E2=80=99y acc=
=C3=A9der.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6202" data-end=3D"6279">
<p data-start=3D"6204" data-end=3D"6279">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6213"=
 data-end=3D"6223">samesite</code> (Strict ou Lax) pour limiter le partage =
inter-domaines.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6281" data-end=3D"6310">9.2. Gestion des sessions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6485">
<li data-start=3D"6312" data-end=3D"6391">
<p data-start=3D"6314" data-end=3D"6391">Les cookies de session (comme <cod=
e data-start=3D"6344" data-end=3D"6355">PHPSESSID</code>) doivent toujours =
=C3=AAtre s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6392" data-end=3D"6485">
<p data-start=3D"6394" data-end=3D"6485">Renouvelez souvent les IDs de sess=
ion (<code data-start=3D"6433" data-end=3D"6458">session_regenerate_id()</c=
ode>) pour limiter les risques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6487" data-end=3D"6567">9.3. Ne jamais stocker d=E2=80=99=
informations sensibles non chiffr=C3=A9es dans un cookie</h3>
