<h2 data-start=3D"7021" data-end=3D"7052">6. R=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 et recommanda=
tions</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7054" data-end=3D"7623">
<li data-start=3D"7054" data-end=3D"7180">
<p data-start=3D"7056" data-end=3D"7180"><strong data-start=3D"7056" data-e=
nd=3D"7067">Cookies</strong> : d=C3=A9finissez une dur=C3=A9e de vie adapt=
=C3=A9e, utilisez les options <code data-start=3D"7128" data-end=3D"7136">s=
ecure</code>, <code data-start=3D"7138" data-end=3D"7148">httponly</code>, =
<code data-start=3D"7150" data-end=3D"7160">samesite</code> pour la s=C3=A9=
curit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7181" data-end=3D"7291">
<p data-start=3D"7183" data-end=3D"7291"><strong data-start=3D"7183" data-e=
nd=3D"7195">Sessions</strong> : contr=C3=B4lez <code data-start=3D"7208" da=
ta-end=3D"7232">session.gc_maxlifetime</code> et <code data-start=3D"7236" =
data-end=3D"7261">session.cookie_lifetime</code> pour g=C3=A9rer la dur=C3=
=A9e de vie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7292" data-end=3D"7358">
<p data-start=3D"7294" data-end=3D"7358">Toujours utiliser HTTPS pour prot=
=C3=A9ger les cookies et sessions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7359" data-end=3D"7431">
<p data-start=3D"7361" data-end=3D"7431">Renouvelez r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement=
 les IDs de session pour =C3=A9viter la fixation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7432" data-end=3D"7499">
<p data-start=3D"7434" data-end=3D"7499">Validez toujours les donn=C3=A9es =
provenant des sessions et cookies.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7500" data-end=3D"7623">
<p data-start=3D"7502" data-end=3D"7623">Pour les applications critiques, e=
nvisagez de stocker les sessions dans un syst=C3=A8me centralis=C3=A9 (Redi=
s, base de donn=C3=A9es).</p>
</li>
</ul>
