nd=3D"1064">Erreurs fatales (Fatal errors)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1065" data-end=3D"1113">
<p data-start=3D"1067" data-end=3D"1113"><strong data-start=3D"1067" data-e=
nd=3D"1113">Erreurs de niveau avertissement (Warnings)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1114" data-end=3D"1154">
<p data-start=3D"1116" data-end=3D"1154"><strong data-start=3D"1116" data-e=
nd=3D"1154">Erreurs de niveau notice (Notices)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1156" data-end=3D"1274">Chacune de ces cat=C3=A9gories cor=
respond =C3=A0 une gravit=C3=A9 diff=C3=A9rente et une cons=C3=A9quence dif=
