<h3 data-start=3D"4283" data-end=3D"4302">2.6. Exceptions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4304" data-end=3D"4543">
<li data-start=3D"4304" data-end=3D"4413">
<p data-start=3D"4306" data-end=3D"4413">PHP 5+ introduit le m=C3=A9canisme=
 des exceptions (<code data-start=3D"4352" data-end=3D"4359">throw</code>, =
<code data-start=3D"4361" data-end=3D"4366">try</code>, <code data-start=3D=
"4368" data-end=3D"4375">catch</code>) pour g=C3=A9rer proprement des erreu=
rs.</p>
