<h2 data-start=3D"5542" data-end=3D"5573">4. Configuration des erreurs</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5575" data-end=3D"5627">4.1. Affichage des erreurs (affic=
hage =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9cran)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5629" data-end=3D"5811">
<li data-start=3D"5629" data-end=3D"5693">
<p data-start=3D"5631" data-end=3D"5693"><code data-start=3D"5631" data-end=
=3D"5647">display_errors</code> : active/d=C3=A9sactive l=E2=80=99affichage=
 des erreurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5694" data-end=3D"5811">
<p data-start=3D"5696" data-end=3D"5811">En production, il est conseill=C3=
=A9 de d=C3=A9sactiver cet affichage (<code data-start=3D"5757" data-end=3D=
"5762">Off</code>) pour ne pas exposer des informations sensibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5813" data-end=3D"5855">4.2. Journalisation des erreurs (=
logs)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5857" data-end=3D"5972">
