<hr data-start=3D"7213" data-end=3D"7216">
<h2 data-start=3D"7218" data-end=3D"7231">Conclusion</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7233" data-end=3D"7604">
<li data-start=3D"7233" data-end=3D"7324">
<p data-start=3D"7235" data-end=3D"7324">Le trio <strong data-start=3D"7243=
" data-end=3D"7272"><code data-start=3D"7245" data-end=3D"7250">try</code>,=
 <code data-start=3D"7252" data-end=3D"7259">catch</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"7261" data-end=3D"7270">finally</code></strong> permet de g=C3=A9rer pr=
oprement les exceptions en PHP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7325" data-end=3D"7442">
<p data-start=3D"7327" data-end=3D"7442"><code data-start=3D"7327" data-end=
=3D"7332">try</code> contient le code risqu=C3=A9, <code data-start=3D"7358=
" data-end=3D"7365">catch</code> capture et traite l=E2=80=99exception, <co=
de data-start=3D"7397" data-end=3D"7406">finally</code> ex=C3=A9cute du cod=
e syst=C3=A9matiquement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7443" data-end=3D"7525">
<p data-start=3D"7445" data-end=3D"7525">La gestion des exceptions favorise=
 un code plus robuste, clair et maintenable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7526" data-end=3D"7604">
<p data-start=3D"7528" data-end=3D"7604">La bonne gestion des exceptions es=
t une comp=C3=A9tence cl=C3=A9 en PHP professionnel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
