<li data-start=3D"3386" data-end=3D"3461">
<p data-start=3D"3388" data-end=3D"3461"><code data-start=3D"3388" data-end=
=3D"3410">ApplicationException</code> est une classe de base pour les erreu=
rs m=C3=A9tiers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3509">
<p data-start=3D"3464" data-end=3D"3509">Les exceptions sp=C3=A9cifiques h=
=C3=A9ritent d=E2=80=99elle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3510" data-end=3D"3585">
<p data-start=3D"3512" data-end=3D"3585">Cela permet de capturer =C3=A0 la =
fois des erreurs sp=C3=A9cifiques ou plus larges.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3587" data-end=3D"3590">
<h2 data-start=3D"3592" data-end=3D"3649">4. Ajouter des propri=C3=A9t=C3=
