.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4584" data-end=3D"4644">
<p data-start=3D"4586" data-end=3D"4644">On surcharge le constructeur pour =
accepter cette donn=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4645" data-end=3D"4702">
<p data-start=3D"4647" data-end=3D"4702">La m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=
