</li>
<li data-start=3D"4703" data-end=3D"4784">
<p data-start=3D"4705" data-end=3D"4784">La m=C3=A9thode magique <code data=
-start=3D"4724" data-end=3D"4738">__toString()</code> est red=C3=A9finie po=
ur un affichage personnalis=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4786" data-end=3D"4789">
