nd=3D"5386">Explication :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5607">
<li data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5425">
<p data-start=3D"5390" data-end=3D"5425">Une exception initiale est lev=C3=
=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5426" data-end=3D"5539">
<p data-start=3D"5428" data-end=3D"5539">Elle est captur=C3=A9e et une nouv=
elle exception plus sp=C3=A9cifique est lev=C3=A9e, en y associant l=E2=80=
=99exception pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5540" data-end=3D"5607">
<p data-start=3D"5542" data-end=3D"5607">On peut acc=C3=A9der =C3=A0 l=E2=
=80=99exception pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dente via <code data-start=3D"5587" data-end=
=3D"5606">$e-&gt;getPrevious()</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5609" data-end=3D"5612">
<h2 data-start=3D"5614" data-end=3D"5656">6. Bonnes pratiques et conseils e=
xperts</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5658" data-end=3D"6478">
<li data-start=3D"5658" data-end=3D"5790">
<p data-start=3D"5660" data-end=3D"5790"><strong data-start=3D"5660" data-e=
nd=3D"5696">Nommez clairement vos exceptions</strong>, refl=C3=A9tant leur =
nature et domaine (ex : <code data-start=3D"5737" data-end=3D"5760">UserNot=
FoundException</code>, <code data-start=3D"5762" data-end=3D"5786">PaymentF=
ailedException</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"5887">
<p data-start=3D"5793" data-end=3D"5887"><strong data-start=3D"5793" data-e=
nd=3D"5825">Cr=C3=A9ez une hi=C3=A9rarchie logique</strong> d=E2=80=99excep=
tions pour faciliter la gestion et la compr=C3=A9hension.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5888" data-end=3D"5967">
<p data-start=3D"5890" data-end=3D"5967"><strong data-start=3D"5890" data-e=
nd=3D"5923">Ajoutez des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s utiles</strong> pour transmett=
re des informations m=C3=A9tier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5968" data-end=3D"6056">
<p data-start=3D"5970" data-end=3D"6056"><strong data-start=3D"5970" data-e=
nd=3D"6005">Utilisez la cha=C3=AEne d=E2=80=99exceptions</strong> pour trac=
er pr=C3=A9cis=C3=A9ment l=E2=80=99origine d=E2=80=99un probl=C3=A8me.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6057" data-end=3D"6147">
<p data-start=3D"6059" data-end=3D"6147"><strong data-start=3D"6059" data-e=
nd=3D"6073">Documentez</strong> vos exceptions avec des PHPDoc (<code data-=
start=3D"6106" data-end=3D"6115">@throws</code>) dans vos fonctions/m=C3=A9=
thodes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6148" data-end=3D"6267">
<p data-start=3D"6150" data-end=3D"6267"><strong data-start=3D"6150" data-e=
nd=3D"6203">Ne capturez pas aveugl=C3=A9ment toutes les exceptions</strong>=
, ne les ignorez pas, et ne cr=C3=A9ez pas des blocs <code data-start=3D"62=
51" data-end=3D"6258">catch</code> vides.</p>
</li>
