<hr data-start=3D"4424" data-end=3D"4427">
<h2 data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4466">3. Mise en place pratique compl=
=C3=A8te</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4468" data-end=3D"4509">3.1. Cr=C3=A9er un dossier <code =
data-start=3D"4494" data-end=3D"4500">logs</code> s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4511" data-end=3D"4792">
<li data-start=3D"4511" data-end=3D"4568">
<p data-start=3D"4513" data-end=3D"4568">Cr=C3=A9ez un dossier <code data-s=
tart=3D"4530" data-end=3D"4537">/logs</code> =C3=A0 la racine de votre proj=
et.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4569" data-end=3D"4681">
<p data-start=3D"4571" data-end=3D"4681">Donnez les droits d=E2=80=99=C3=A9=
criture au serveur web (ex: <code data-start=3D"4620" data-end=3D"4636">chm=
od 755 logs</code>, ou <code data-start=3D"4641" data-end=3D"4657">chmod 77=
5 logs</code> selon l=E2=80=99utilisateur).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4682" data-end=3D"4792">
<p data-start=3D"4684" data-end=3D"4792">Interdisez l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s HT=
TP direct (ex: via un fichier <code data-start=3D"4735" data-end=3D"4746">.=
htaccess</code> contenant <code data-start=3D"4757" data-end=3D"4772">deny =
from all</code> si serveur Apache).</p>
</li>
</ul>
