<hr data-start=3D"7698" data-end=3D"7701">
<h2 data-start=3D"7703" data-end=3D"7731">9. R=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des points cl=
=C3=A9s</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7733" data-end=3D"8370">
<li data-start=3D"7733" data-end=3D"7826">
<p data-start=3D"7735" data-end=3D"7826">L=E2=80=99h=C3=A9ritage permet de =
cr=C3=A9er une classe enfant =C3=A0 partir d=E2=80=99une classe parent avec=
 <code data-start=3D"7814" data-end=3D"7823">extends</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7827" data-end=3D"7906">
<p data-start=3D"7829" data-end=3D"7906">La classe enfant h=C3=A9rite des p=
ropri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s et m=C3=A9thodes <code data-start=3D"7880" data-end=3D"=
7888">public</code> et <code data-start=3D"7892" data-end=3D"7903">protecte=
d</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7907" data-end=3D"7953">
<p data-start=3D"7909" data-end=3D"7953">Les m=C3=A9thodes priv=C3=A9es ne =
sont pas h=C3=A9rit=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7954" data-end=3D"8056">
<p data-start=3D"7956" data-end=3D"8056">Le constructeur parent doit =C3=AA=
tre appel=C3=A9 explicitement si la classe enfant d=C3=A9finit un construct=
eur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8057" data-end=3D"8170">
<p data-start=3D"8059" data-end=3D"8170">On peut red=C3=A9finir les m=C3=A9=
thodes h=C3=A9rit=C3=A9es (surcharge) et utiliser <code data-start=3D"8123"=
 data-end=3D"8133">parent::</code> pour appeler la m=C3=A9thode originale.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8171" data-end=3D"8271">
<p data-start=3D"8173" data-end=3D"8271">Les m=C3=A9thodes et classes peuve=
nt =C3=AAtre d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9es <code data-start=3D"8220" data-end=3D"8227=
