<hr data-start=3D"192" data-end=3D"195">
<h1 data-start=3D"197" data-end=3D"292">Programmation interm=C3=A9diaire av=
ec PHP =E2=86=92 Introduction =C3=A0 la Programmation Orient=C3=A9e Objet (=
POO)</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"293" data-end=3D"340">Encapsulation (public, private, pro=
tected)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"341" data-end=3D"371"><strong data-start=3D"341" data-end=
=3D"371">Niveau : D=C3=A9butant =C3=A0 Expert</strong></p>
<hr data-start=3D"373" data-end=3D"376">
<h2 data-start=3D"378" data-end=3D"414">1. Introduction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99en=
capsulation</h2>
<p data-start=3D"416" data-end=3D"646">L=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"418"=
 data-end=3D"435">encapsulation</strong> est un principe fondamental de la =
POO qui consiste =C3=A0 regrouper les donn=C3=A9es (propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s) e=
t les comportements (m=C3=A9thodes) dans une m=C3=AAme entit=C3=A9 : la cla=
sse, et =C3=A0 contr=C3=B4ler l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 ces donn=C3=A9es =
depuis l=E2=80=99ext=C3=A9rieur.</p>
<p data-start=3D"648" data-end=3D"672">L=E2=80=99encapsulation permet :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"674" data-end=3D"933">
<li data-start=3D"674" data-end=3D"747">
<p data-start=3D"676" data-end=3D"747">De <strong data-start=3D"679" data-e=
nd=3D"691">prot=C3=A9ger</strong> les donn=C3=A9es internes d=E2=80=99un ob=
jet (s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"748" data-end=3D"842">
<p data-start=3D"750" data-end=3D"842">De <strong data-start=3D"753" data-e=
nd=3D"764">masquer</strong> la complexit=C3=A9 interne et ne r=C3=A9v=C3=A9=
ler que ce qui est n=C3=A9cessaire (abstraction)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"843" data-end=3D"933">
<p data-start=3D"845" data-end=3D"933">De <strong data-start=3D"848" data-e=
nd=3D"861">contr=C3=B4ler</strong> comment les donn=C3=A9es sont lues ou mo=
difi=C3=A9es (via des m=C3=A9thodes d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"1011">En PHP, l=E2=80=99encapsulation est=
 r=C3=A9alis=C3=A9e via les modificateurs de visibilit=C3=A9 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1052">
<li data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1024">
<p data-start=3D"1014" data-end=3D"1024"><code data-start=3D"1014" data-end=
=3D"1022">public</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1025" data-end=3D"1038">
<p data-start=3D"1027" data-end=3D"1038"><code data-start=3D"1027" data-end=
=3D"1036">private</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1039" data-end=3D"1052">
<p data-start=3D"1041" data-end=3D"1052"><code data-start=3D"1041" data-end=
=3D"1052">protected</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1054" data-end=3D"1057">
<h2 data-start=3D"1059" data-end=3D"1106">2. Les modificateurs de visibilit=
=C3=A9 en d=C3=A9tail</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1108" data-end=3D"1125">2.1. <code data-start=3D"1117" da=
ta-end=3D"1125">public</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1353">
<li data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1314">
<p data-start=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1314">Les propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s ou m=C3=
=A9thodes d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9es <code data-start=3D"1166" data-end=3D"1174">p=
ublic</code> sont accessibles <strong data-start=3D"1192" data-end=3D"1206"=
>de partout</strong> : =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9rieur de la classe, dans l=
es classes enfants, et depuis l=E2=80=99ext=C3=A9rieur (par exemple via un =
objet).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1353">
<p data-start=3D"1317" data-end=3D"1353">C=E2=80=99est la visibilit=C3=A9 l=
a plus ouverte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
