<hr data-start=3D"2372" data-end=3D"2375">
<h3 data-start=3D"2377" data-end=3D"2404">2.4. R=C3=A8gles importantes</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2406" data-end=3D"2818">
<li data-start=3D"2406" data-end=3D"2481">
<p data-start=3D"2408" data-end=3D"2481">Une classe abstraite <strong data-=
start=3D"2429" data-end=3D"2437">doit</strong> =C3=AAtre d=C3=A9clar=C3=A9e=
 avec le mot-cl=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D"2468" data-end=3D"2478">abstract<=
/code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2482" data-end=3D"2607">
<p data-start=3D"2484" data-end=3D"2607">Une m=C3=A9thode abstraite <strong=
 data-start=3D"2506" data-end=3D"2514">doit</strong> =C3=AAtre d=C3=A9clar=
=C3=A9e sans corps, avec le mot-cl=C3=A9 <code data-start=3D"2557" data-end=
=3D"2567">abstract</code>, et <strong data-start=3D"2572" data-end=3D"2587"=
>ne peut pas</strong> contenir de code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2608" data-end=3D"2727">
<p data-start=3D"2610" data-end=3D"2727">Toute classe enfant <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2630" data-end=3D"2681">doit impl=C3=A9menter toutes les m=C3=A9tho=
des abstraites</strong> h=C3=A9rit=C3=A9es, sauf si elle est aussi abstrait=
e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2728" data-end=3D"2818">
<p data-start=3D"2730" data-end=3D"2818">Les m=C3=A9thodes abstraites doive=
nt avoir une visibilit=C3=A9 compatible (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement <code data-=
start=3D"2808" data-end=3D"2816">public</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2820" data-end=3D"2823">
<h2 data-start=3D"2825" data-end=3D"2848">3. Interfaces en PHP</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2850" data-end=3D"2887">3.1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce qu=E2=80=
=99une interface ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2889" data-end=3D"3270">
<li data-start=3D"2889" data-end=3D"2968">
<p data-start=3D"2891" data-end=3D"2968">Une <strong data-start=3D"2895" da=
ta-end=3D"2908">interface</strong> d=C3=A9finit un <strong data-start=3D"29=
20" data-end=3D"2931">contrat</strong> que les classes doivent respecter.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2969" data-end=3D"3070">
<p data-start=3D"2971" data-end=3D"3070">Elle ne contient <strong data-star=
t=3D"2988" data-end=3D"3013">aucune impl=C3=A9mentation</strong>, uniquemen=
t des d=C3=A9clarations de m=C3=A9thodes (sans corps).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3071" data-end=3D"3172">
<p data-start=3D"3073" data-end=3D"3172">Une classe peut impl=C3=A9menter p=
lusieurs interfaces, permettant ainsi une forme de "multi-h=C3=A9ritage".</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3173" data-end=3D"3270">
<p data-start=3D"3175" data-end=3D"3270">Les m=C3=A9thodes d=E2=80=99une in=
terface sont toujours <code data-start=3D"3218" data-end=3D"3226">public</c=
ode> et doivent =C3=AAtre impl=C3=A9ment=C3=A9es par la classe.</p>
</li>
</ul>
