<h2 data-start=3D"6325" data-end=3D"6362">13. Autoloading : bonnes pratique=
s</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6758">
<li data-start=3D"6364" data-end=3D"6451">
<p data-start=3D"6366" data-end=3D"6451">Utilisez <code data-start=3D"6375"=
 data-end=3D"6400">spl_autoload_register()</code> et non plus la fonction o=
