>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6452" data-end=3D"6512">
<p data-start=3D"6454" data-end=3D"6512">Respectez la correspondance namesp=
ace =E2=86=92 dossier (PSR-4).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6513" data-end=3D"6577">
<p data-start=3D"6515" data-end=3D"6577">V=C3=A9rifiez toujours que les fic=
hiers existent avant d=E2=80=99inclure.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6578" data-end=3D"6617">
<p data-start=3D"6580" data-end=3D"6617">Utilisez Composer d=C3=A8s que pos=
sible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6618" data-end=3D"6686">
<p data-start=3D"6620" data-end=3D"6686">Ne surchargez pas inutilement le n=
ombre de fonctions d=E2=80=99autoload.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6687" data-end=3D"6758">
<p data-start=3D"6689" data-end=3D"6758">Documentez votre structure de fich=
iers pour faciliter la maintenance.</p>
</li>
</ul>
