<ul data-start=3D"4020" data-end=3D"4239">
<li data-start=3D"4020" data-end=3D"4094">
<p data-start=3D"4022" data-end=3D"4094">LSB fonctionne <strong data-start=
=3D"4037" data-end=3D"4093">uniquement avec des m=C3=A9thodes et propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9s statiques</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4095" data-end=3D"4152">
<p data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4152">Il ne s=E2=80=99applique pas aux r=
=C3=A9f=C3=A9rences dynamiques <code data-start=3D"4144" data-end=3D"4151">=
