</li>
<li data-start=3D"4153" data-end=3D"4239">
<p data-start=3D"4155" data-end=3D"4239"><code data-start=3D"4155" data-end=
=3D"4165">parent::</code> continue =C3=A0 r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rencer la classe pa=
rente directe, pas la classe appelante.</p>
</li>
</ul>
