<hr data-start=3D"7795" data-end=3D"7798">
<h2 data-start=3D"7800" data-end=3D"7844">=F0=9F=A7=A0 6. Bonnes pratiques =
et pi=C3=A8ges =C3=A0 =C3=A9viter</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7846" data-end=3D"8506">
<li data-start=3D"7846" data-end=3D"7941">
<p data-start=3D"7848" data-end=3D"7941"><strong data-start=3D"7848" data-e=
nd=3D"7865">Ne pas abuser</strong> des m=C3=A9thodes magiques, elles peuven=
t rendre le code difficile =C3=A0 comprendre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7942" data-end=3D"8005">
<p data-start=3D"7944" data-end=3D"8005">Documenter pr=C3=A9cis=C3=A9ment l=
e comportement des m=C3=A9thodes magiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8006" data-end=3D"8113">
<p data-start=3D"8008" data-end=3D"8113">Attention aux performances : l=E2=
=80=99utilisation excessive de <code data-start=3D"8064" data-end=3D"8071">=
__get</code>, <code data-start=3D"8073" data-end=3D"8080">__set</code> peut=
 ralentir votre application.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8114" data-end=3D"8191">
<p data-start=3D"8116" data-end=3D"8191">Toujours v=C3=A9rifier que <code d=
ata-start=3D"8138" data-end=3D"8152">__toString()</code> renvoie bien une c=
ha=C3=AEne de caract=C3=A8res.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8192" data-end=3D"8292">
<p data-start=3D"8194" data-end=3D"8292">M=C3=A9thodes magiques n=E2=80=99o=
nt pas de v=C3=A9rification stricte de signature (argument, type), soyez pr=
udents.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8293" data-end=3D"8409">
<p data-start=3D"8295" data-end=3D"8409">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer des m=C3=A9thod=
es explicites quand c=E2=80=99est possible, les magies doivent servir =C3=
=A0 des cas sp=C3=A9cifiques et avanc=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8410" data-end=3D"8506">
<p data-start=3D"8412" data-end=3D"8506">Tester intensivement le comporteme=
nt des m=C3=A9thodes magiques surtout dans des classes complexes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
