</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5987" data-end=3D"5990">
<h3 data-start=3D"5992" data-end=3D"6025">3. Le fichier <code data-start=3D=
"6010" data-end=3D"6025">composer.lock</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6027" data-end=3D"6212">
<li data-start=3D"6027" data-end=3D"6078">
<p data-start=3D"6029" data-end=3D"6078">Contient la liste exacte des versi=
ons install=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6079" data-end=3D"6170">
<p data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6170">Doit =C3=AAtre commit dans git pou=
r garantir que tous les d=C3=A9veloppeurs ont les m=C3=AAmes versions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6171" data-end=3D"6212">
<p data-start=3D"6173" data-end=3D"6212">Permet des d=C3=A9ploiements repro=
ductibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6214" data-end=3D"6217">
<h3 data-start=3D"6219" data-end=3D"6259">4. R=C3=A9soudre les conflits de =
versions</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6261" data-end=3D"6391">Composer d=C3=A9tecte les conflits=
 et vous informe des incompatibilit=C3=A9s. Utilisez les versions compatibl=
es ou modifiez les contraintes.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6393" data-end=3D"6396">
<h2 data-start=3D"6398" data-end=3D"6454">Partie 6 : Publier vos propres pa=
ckages avec Composer</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"6456" data-end=3D"6459">
<h3 data-start=3D"6461" data-end=3D"6492">1. Structurer votre package</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6494" data-end=3D"6653">
<li data-start=3D"6494" data-end=3D"6529">
<p data-start=3D"6496" data-end=3D"6529">Cr=C3=A9ez un dossier avec votre c=
ode.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6530" data-end=3D"6578">
<p data-start=3D"6532" data-end=3D"6578">Ajoutez un <code data-start=3D"654=
3" data-end=3D"6558">composer.json</code> avec un nom unique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6579" data-end=3D"6625">
<p data-start=3D"6581" data-end=3D"6625">Respectez la norme PSR-4 pour l=E2=
=80=99autoloading.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6653">
<p data-start=3D"6628" data-end=3D"6653">Documentez votre package.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6655" data-end=3D"6658">
<h3 data-start=3D"6660" data-end=3D"6688">2. Publier sur Packagist</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"6865">
<li data-start=3D"6690" data-end=3D"6751">
<p data-start=3D"6692" data-end=3D"6751">Inscrivez-vous sur <a data-start=
=3D"6711" data-end=3D"6750" rel=3D"noopener" target=3D"_new" class=3D"" hre=
f=3D"https://packagist.org/">packagist.org</a>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6752" data-end=3D"6798">
<p data-start=3D"6754" data-end=3D"6798">Soumettez votre d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t Gi=
t (GitHub, GitLab=E2=80=A6).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6799" data-end=3D"6865">
<p data-start=3D"6801" data-end=3D"6865">Packagist d=C3=A9tecte automatique=
ment les versions tagu=C3=A9es dans Git.</p>
</li>
</ul>
