<hr data-start=3D"2837" data-end=3D"2840">
<h2 data-start=3D"2842" data-end=3D"2876">Partie 3 : Assertions courantes</=
h2>
<hr data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"2881">
<h3 data-start=3D"2883" data-end=3D"2924">1. <code data-start=3D"2890" data=
-end=3D"2924">assertEquals($expected, $actual)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2926" data-end=3D"2963">V=C3=A9rifie que deux valeurs sont=
 =C3=A9gales.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2965" data-end=3D"3004">2. <code data-start=3D"2972" data=
-end=3D"3004">assertSame($expected, $actual)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3006" data-end=3D"3079">V=C3=A9rifie que deux valeurs sont=
 identiques (=C3=A9galit=C3=A9 stricte, type compris).</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3081" data-end=3D"3140">3. <code data-start=3D"3088" data=
-end=3D"3112">assertTrue($condition)</code> / <code data-start=3D"3115" dat=
a-end=3D"3140">assertFalse($condition)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3142" data-end=3D"3170">Test de condition bool=C3=A9enne.<=
/p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3172" data-end=3D"3199">4. <code data-start=3D"3179" data=
-end=3D"3199">assertNull($value)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3201" data-end=3D"3230">Test si la valeur est <code data-s=
tart=3D"3223" data-end=3D"3229">null</code>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3232" data-end=3D"3274">5. <code data-start=3D"3239" data=
-end=3D"3274">assertInstanceOf($class, $object)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3276" data-end=3D"3329">V=C3=A9rifie qu=E2=80=99un objet e=
st instance d=E2=80=99une classe donn=C3=A9e.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3386">6. <code data-start=3D"3338" data=
-end=3D"3386">assertCount($expectedCount, $arrayOrCountable)</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3388" data-end=3D"3455">V=C3=A9rifie le nombre d=E2=80=99=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans un tableau ou un objet countable.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3457" data-end=3D"3460">
<h2 data-start=3D"3462" data-end=3D"3506">Partie 4 : Organisation avanc=C3=
=A9e des tests</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"3508" data-end=3D"3511">
<h3 data-start=3D"3513" data-end=3D"3554">1. M=C3=A9thodes <code data-start=
=3D"3529" data-end=3D"3538">setUp()</code> et <code data-start=3D"3542" dat=
a-end=3D"3554">tearDown()</code></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3556" data-end=3D"3682">
<li data-start=3D"3556" data-end=3D"3622">
<p data-start=3D"3558" data-end=3D"3622"><code data-start=3D"3558" data-end=
=3D"3567">setUp()</code> : ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e avant chaque test, pour initi=
aliser l=E2=80=99=C3=A9tat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3623" data-end=3D"3682">
<p data-start=3D"3625" data-end=3D"3682"><code data-start=3D"3625" data-end=
=3D"3637">tearDown()</code> : ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e apr=C3=A8s chaque test, po=
ur nettoyer.</p>
</li>
</ul>
