<hr data-start=3D"7966" data-end=3D"7969">
<h2 data-start=3D"7971" data-end=3D"7984">Conclusion</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"7986" data-end=3D"7989">
<p data-start=3D"7991" data-end=3D"8152">Le <strong data-start=3D"7994" dat=
a-end=3D"8005">mocking</strong> est une technique puissante pour rendre les=
 tests unitaires fiables, rapides, et ind=C3=A9pendants des d=C3=A9pendance=
s externes. Bien ma=C3=AEtris=C3=A9, il permet :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8154" data-end=3D"8318">
<li data-start=3D"8154" data-end=3D"8193">
<p data-start=3D"8156" data-end=3D"8193">D=E2=80=99isoler parfaitement l=E2=
=80=99unit=C3=A9 test=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8194" data-end=3D"8247">
<p data-start=3D"8196" data-end=3D"8247">De simuler facilement des comporte=
ments et erreurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8248" data-end=3D"8318">
<p data-start=3D"8250" data-end=3D"8318">De valider que les interactions av=
ec les d=C3=A9pendances sont correctes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8320" data-end=3D"8335">En r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"8337" data-end=3D"8689">
<li data-start=3D"8337" data-end=3D"8397">
<p data-start=3D"8339" data-end=3D"8397">Comprendre la diff=C3=A9rence entr=
e mocks, stubs, fakes, spies.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8398" data-end=3D"8483">
<p data-start=3D"8400" data-end=3D"8483">Utiliser PHPUnit pour cr=C3=A9er d=
es mocks, d=C3=A9finir des attentes et simuler des retours.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8484" data-end=3D"8554">
<p data-start=3D"8486" data-end=3D"8554">=C3=89viter les abus et bien struc=
turer le code pour faciliter les tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8555" data-end=3D"8636">
<p data-start=3D"8557" data-end=3D"8636">Approfondir avec des mocks partiel=
s, mocks d=E2=80=99exceptions, v=C3=A9rifications d=E2=80=99ordre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8637" data-end=3D"8689">
<p data-start=3D"8639" data-end=3D"8689">Compl=C3=A9ter avec des tests d=E2=
=80=99int=C3=A9gration sans mocks.</p>
</li>
</ul>
