xpert</h1>
<hr data-start=3D"391" data-end=3D"394">
<h2 data-start=3D"396" data-end=3D"432">Introduction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99analy=
se statique</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"434" data-end=3D"437">
<h3 data-start=3D"439" data-end=3D"477">Qu=E2=80=99est-ce que l=E2=80=99ana=
lyse statique ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"479" data-end=3D"612">L=E2=80=99analyse statique est un pr=
ocessus automatis=C3=A9 qui consiste =C3=A0 analyser le code source sans l=
=E2=80=99ex=C3=A9cuter. En PHP, elle sert =C3=A0 d=C3=A9tecter :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"884">
<li data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"691">
<p data-start=3D"616" data-end=3D"691">Les erreurs potentielles (typos, app=
els =C3=A0 des m=C3=A9thodes inexistantes, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"692" data-end=3D"774">
<p data-start=3D"694" data-end=3D"774">Les probl=C3=A8mes de type (incompat=
ibilit=C3=A9s, mauvais retours, arguments incorrects).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"829">
<p data-start=3D"777" data-end=3D"829">Les mauvaises pratiques et violation=
s des standards.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"830" data-end=3D"884">
<p data-start=3D"832" data-end=3D"884">La complexit=C3=A9 du code et d=E2=
=80=99autres m=C3=A9triques qualit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"886" data-end=3D"889">
<h3 data-start=3D"891" data-end=3D"933">Pourquoi utiliser l=E2=80=99analyse=
 statique ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"1324">
<li data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"996">
<p data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"996"><strong data-start=3D"937" data-end=
=3D"957">Fiabilit=C3=A9 accrue</strong> : d=C3=A9tecter des bugs avant l=E2=
=80=99ex=C3=A9cution.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"997" data-end=3D"1073">
<p data-start=3D"999" data-end=3D"1073"><strong data-start=3D"999" data-end=
=3D"1037">Am=C3=A9lioration de la qualit=C3=A9 du code</strong> : d=C3=A9te=
cter les mauvaises pratiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1074" data-end=3D"1137">
<p data-start=3D"1076" data-end=3D"1137"><strong data-start=3D"1076" data-e=
nd=3D"1103">Documentation implicite</strong> : gr=C3=A2ce aux annotations d=
e types.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1138" data-end=3D"1215">
<p data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1215"><strong data-start=3D"1140" data-e=
nd=3D"1168">Faciliter la maintenance</strong> : en rendant le code plus cla=
ir et pr=C3=A9visible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1216" data-end=3D"1324">
<p data-start=3D"1218" data-end=3D"1324"><strong data-start=3D"1218" data-e=
nd=3D"1242">Compl=C3=A9ment des tests</strong> : l=E2=80=99analyse statique=
 d=C3=A9tecte des erreurs que les tests ne couvrent pas forc=C3=A9ment.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1326" data-end=3D"1329">
<h3 data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1367">Outils phares : PHPStan et Psalm<=
