<ul data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1589">
<li data-start=3D"1369" data-end=3D"1458">
<p data-start=3D"1371" data-end=3D"1458"><strong data-start=3D"1371" data-e=
nd=3D"1382">PHPStan</strong> : orient=C3=A9 analyse statique de types, faci=
le =C3=A0 configurer et tr=C3=A8s populaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1459" data-end=3D"1589">
<p data-start=3D"1461" data-end=3D"1589"><strong data-start=3D"1461" data-e=
nd=3D"1470">Psalm</strong> : offre des fonctionnalit=C3=A9s avanc=C3=A9es, =
