<h2 data-start=3D"278" data-end=3D"293">Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"295" data-end=3D"371">Le <strong data-start=3D"298" data-e=
nd=3D"309">linting</strong> et le <strong data-start=3D"316" data-end=3D"32=
9">formatage</strong> sont deux piliers de la qualit=C3=A9 de code :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"373" data-end=3D"660">
<li data-start=3D"373" data-end=3D"508">
<p data-start=3D"375" data-end=3D"508">Le <strong data-start=3D"378" data-e=
nd=3D"389">linting</strong> analyse votre code pour y d=C3=A9tecter des <st=
rong data-start=3D"429" data-end=3D"507">erreurs de syntaxe, des violations=
 de conventions de style ou de structure</strong>.</p>
