<li data-start=3D"509" data-end=3D"660">
<p data-start=3D"511" data-end=3D"660">Le <strong data-start=3D"514" data-e=
nd=3D"527">formatage</strong> applique automatiquement des <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"557" data-end=3D"586">r=C3=A8gles de style de codage</strong> (indent=
ation, espaces, retours =C3=A0 la ligne, etc.) de mani=C3=A8re <strong data=
-start=3D"647" data-end=3D"659">uniforme</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D"786">
<p data-start=3D"664" data-end=3D"786">En PHP, ces pratiques permettent une=
