<h3 data-start=3D"5120" data-end=3D"5164">Cr=C3=A9er ses propres r=C3=A8gle=
s PHP_CodeSniffer</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5166" data-end=3D"5248">Il est possible d=E2=80=99=C3=A9cr=
ire une classe qui h=C3=A9rite de <code data-start=3D"5216" data-end=3D"524=
7">\PHP_CodeSniffer\Sniffs\Sniff</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5250" data-end=3D"5356">Cela permet de d=C3=A9tecter des v=
iolations sp=C3=A9cifiques =C3=A0 un projet (naming conventions, logique m=
=C3=A9tier, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5358" data-end=3D"5361">
<h3 data-start=3D"5363" data-end=3D"5393">Personnaliser PHP-CS-Fixer</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5395" data-end=3D"5443">Vous pouvez aussi cr=C3=A9er vos p=
