<hr data-start=3D"5583" data-end=3D"5586">
<h2 data-start=3D"5588" data-end=3D"5618">Partie 6 : Bonnes pratiques</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"5620" data-end=3D"5623">
<h3 data-start=3D"5625" data-end=3D"5636">=C3=80 faire</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5944">
<li data-start=3D"5638" data-end=3D"5727">
<p data-start=3D"5640" data-end=3D"5727">D=C3=A9finir un <strong data-start=
=3D"5651" data-end=3D"5679">fichier de configuration</strong> propre (<code=
 data-start=3D"5688" data-end=3D"5699">phpcs.xml</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"5701" data-end=3D"5725">.php-cs-fixer.dist.php</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5728" data-end=3D"5770">
<p data-start=3D"5730" data-end=3D"5770">Int=C3=A9grer dans la <strong data=
-start=3D"5747" data-end=3D"5769">CI/CD et Git hooks</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5771" data-end=3D"5828">
<p data-start=3D"5773" data-end=3D"5828">Documenter les r=C3=A8gles utilis=
=C3=A9es (PSR12, Symfony, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5829" data-end=3D"5890">
<p data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"5890">Exclure les fichiers temporaires (=
<code data-start=3D"5865" data-end=3D"5873">vendor</code>, <code data-start=
=3D"5875" data-end=3D"5882">cache</code>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5891" data-end=3D"5944">
<p data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5944">Lancer r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement <co=
de data-start=3D"5914" data-end=3D"5925">--dry-run</code> avant commit/push=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5946" data-end=3D"5949">
<h3 data-start=3D"5951" data-end=3D"5963">=C3=80 =C3=A9viter</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5965" data-end=3D"6233">
<li data-start=3D"5965" data-end=3D"6019">
<p data-start=3D"5967" data-end=3D"6019">Ne pas formater manuellement =E2=
=86=92 utilisez les outils !</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6020" data-end=3D"6106">
<p data-start=3D"6022" data-end=3D"6106">Ne pas ignorer les messages de lin=
t : ils pr=C3=A9viennent souvent des erreurs critiques.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6107" data-end=3D"6158">
<p data-start=3D"6109" data-end=3D"6158">Ne pas forcer les r=C3=A8gles sans=
 consensus d=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6159" data-end=3D"6233">
<p data-start=3D"6161" data-end=3D"6233">Ne pas ex=C3=A9cuter sur toute la =
base de code sans test =E2=86=92 utiliser <code data-start=3D"6224" data-en=
d=3D"6232">--diff</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6235" data-end=3D"6238">
<h2 data-start=3D"6240" data-end=3D"6253">Conclusion</h2>
<hr data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6258">
<p data-start=3D"6260" data-end=3D"6403">Le linting et le formatage sont <s=
trong data-start=3D"6292" data-end=3D"6343">fondamentaux pour tout projet P=
HP professionnel</strong>. Gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 des outils comme PHP_CodeSniff=
er et PHP-CS-Fixer :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6405" data-end=3D"6578">
<li data-start=3D"6405" data-end=3D"6456">
<p data-start=3D"6407" data-end=3D"6456">Vous d=C3=A9tectez les erreurs d=
=C3=A8s l=E2=80=99=C3=A9criture du code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6457" data-end=3D"6507">
<p data-start=3D"6459" data-end=3D"6507">Vous standardisez l=E2=80=99ensemb=
le de la base de code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6508" data-end=3D"6578">
<p data-start=3D"6510" data-end=3D"6578">Vous facilitez les relectures, les=
 merge requests et la maintenance.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6580" data-end=3D"6598">=F0=9F=8E=AF <strong data-start=3D=
"6583" data-end=3D"6598">En r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"6600" data-end=3D"6765">
<li data-start=3D"6600" data-end=3D"6644">
<p data-start=3D"6602" data-end=3D"6644"><code data-start=3D"6602" data-end=
=3D"6610">php -l</code> : v=C3=A9rification syntaxique rapide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6645" data-end=3D"6681">
<p data-start=3D"6647" data-end=3D"6681"><code data-start=3D"6647" data-end=
=3D"6654">phpcs</code> : respect des conventions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6682" data-end=3D"6723">
<p data-start=3D"6684" data-end=3D"6723"><code data-start=3D"6684" data-end=
=3D"6698">php-cs-fixer</code> : formatage automatique.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6724" data-end=3D"6765">
<p data-start=3D"6726" data-end=3D"6765">Int=C3=A9gration Git et CI pour au=
tomatiser.</p>
</li>
</ul>
