</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7060" data-end=3D"7063">
<h2 data-start=3D"7065" data-end=3D"7080">=E2=9C=85 Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start=3D"7082" data-end=3D"7247">Le t=C3=A9l=C3=A9versement de fich=
iers est une <strong data-start=3D"7119" data-end=3D"7146">fonctionnalit=C3=
=A9 critique</strong> qui n=C3=A9cessite de la rigueur. PHP fournit tous le=
s outils pour s=C3=A9curiser le traitement des fichiers :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7413">
<li data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7294">
<p data-start=3D"7251" data-end=3D"7294">Valider <strong data-start=3D"7259=
" data-end=3D"7267">type</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7269" data-end=3D"=
7279">taille</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"7281" data-end=3D"7294">extens=
ion</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7295" data-end=3D"7326">
<p data-start=3D"7297" data-end=3D"7326">=C3=89chapper les noms de fichiers=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7327" data-end=3D"7359">
<p data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7359">Stocker en dehors du <code data-st=
