</li>
<li data-start=3D"7360" data-end=3D"7413">
<p data-start=3D"7362" data-end=3D"7413"><strong data-start=3D"7362" data-e=
nd=3D"7413">Ne jamais faire confiance aux donn=C3=A9es du client</strong></=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7415" data-end=3D"7587">En appliquant ces bonnes pratiques=
