<hr data-start=3D"950" data-end=3D"953">
<h2 data-start=3D"955" data-end=3D"995">2. =F0=9F=93=9A Comprendre les paqu=
ets Composer</h2>
<p data-start=3D"997" data-end=3D"1133">Un <strong data-start=3D"1000" data=
-end=3D"1019">paquet Composer</strong> est une biblioth=C3=A8que PHP r=C3=
=A9pertori=C3=A9e sur Packagist, avec une structure d=C3=A9finie (nom, vers=
ion, d=C3=A9pendances, etc.).</p>
<p data-start=3D"1135" data-end=3D"1158">Chaque paquet poss=C3=A8de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1333">
<li data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1206">
<p data-start=3D"1161" data-end=3D"1206">Un <strong data-start=3D"1164" dat=
a-end=3D"1178">nom unique</strong> : par ex. <code data-start=3D"1189" data=
-end=3D"1206">monolog/monolog</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1207" data-end=3D"1268">
<p data-start=3D"1209" data-end=3D"1268">Une <strong data-start=3D"1213" da=
ta-end=3D"1235">version s=C3=A9mantique</strong> : <code data-start=3D"1238=
" data-end=3D"1246">1.26.1</code>, <code data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"12=
54">^2.0</code>, <code data-start=3D"1256" data-end=3D"1262">~1.3</code>, e=
tc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1269" data-end=3D"1297">
<p data-start=3D"1271" data-end=3D"1297">Un fichier <code data-start=3D"128=
2" data-end=3D"1297">composer.json</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1333">
<p data-start=3D"1300" data-end=3D"1333">Un d=C3=A9p=C3=B4t Git (souvent su=
r GitHub)</p>
</li>
</ul>
