<p data-start=3D"5006" data-end=3D"5051">PSR-11 : conteneur d=E2=80=99injec=
tion de d=C3=A9pendances</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5053" data-end=3D"5085">b) Dependency Injection (DI)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5087" data-end=3D"5260">Les frameworks modernes comme <str=
ong data-start=3D"5117" data-end=3D"5128">Symfony</strong> et <strong data-=
start=3D"5132" data-end=3D"5143">Laravel</strong> utilisent <strong data-st=
art=3D"5154" data-end=3D"5184">l=E2=80=99injection de d=C3=A9pendances</str=
ong> et des conteneurs de services pour s=C3=A9parer la configuration de l'=
ex=C3=A9cution.</p>
